1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,041
What?

2
00:00:01,167 --> 00:00:02,167
Couch.

3
00:00:02,335 --> 00:00:03,503
We can't end it like this.

4
00:00:04,003 --> 00:00:05,523
Give us time until
the next tournament.

5
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,464
I swear

6
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:08,967
we'll deliver the results.

7
00:00:18,935 --> 00:00:21,021
Why did you say that
without consulting others?

8
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:22,438
Then

9
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:24,614
do we just wait until
our club gets shut down?

10
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:25,817
I didn't say that.

11
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:28,319
We should think
about other ways.

12
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:31,156
Why did you outright say
we'd get results?

13
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,490
Not so confident, huh?

14
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:34,117
What?

15
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:35,368
Never mind.

16
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:36,995
I can do it alone.

17
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:39,087
All you have to do
is to catch my balls right.

18
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:40,122
Is baseball

19
00:00:40,665 --> 00:00:41,707
something you do alone?

20
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:43,376
Without a team,
there can be no pitcher.

21
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:45,670
Then prove you're better
that me and shut me up.

22
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:51,509
Alright.

23
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:54,137
Step up to the mound and
let's see what you've got.

24
00:00:54,429 --> 00:00:56,681
If you throw ten balls inside
my glove precisely

25
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:58,182
I will do as you say.

26
00:00:58,349 --> 00:00:59,517
But if you fail

27
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:01,478
You're going to train my way.

28
00:01:03,271 --> 00:01:04,272
Not too confident, huh?

29
00:01:08,443 --> 00:01:10,945
I'm not sure if you could
catch my ball right.

30
00:01:13,198 --> 00:01:14,198
Ten balls.

31
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:16,826
You think you can
land all ten pitches?

32
00:01:17,118 --> 00:01:19,120
It's over for you too
if you can't catch my ball.
